# Without a nonland permanent leaving (the control for insatiable-skittermaw-void-...), nothing happens at the end step:
# the Skittermaw is still a 2/2 with no counter after Bot1's turns 1 and 3. Lands leaving do not count either: on turn 3
# Bot1 plays a fetch land, cracks it and the Skittermaw stays 2/2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Insatiable Skittermaw
Bloodstained Mire
Island x2
Swamp x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Insatiable Skittermaw.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Insatiable Skittermaw.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Bloodstained Mire.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Bloodstained Mire.Activate
Bot1.Search(Swamp)
[T4 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Insatiable Skittermaw.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Insatiable Skittermaw.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Insatiable Skittermaw.Toughness = 2
